{"id":178,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day."},{"games":["Sword","Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"They say that it stays still and quiet because it is seeing both the past and future at the same time."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"While it can see the future, it has no desire to change it, which is probably why it remains motionless at all times."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It’s said that while this Pokémon has the power to predict the future, it’s not powerful enough to change the future it sees."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Xatu is known to stand motionless while staring at the sun all day long. Some people revere it as a mystical Pokémon out of their belief that Xatu is in possession of the power to see into the future."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Xatu stands rooted and still in one spot all day long. People believe that this Pokémon does so out of fear of the terrible things it has foreseen in the future."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"Once it begins to meditate at sunrise, the entire day will pass before it will move again."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"In South America, it is said that its right eye sees the future and its left eye views the past."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It has the enigmatic power of foreseeing the future. Some people in different lands have long believed that XATU are emissaries from another world."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Synchronize","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is burned, paralyzed, or poisoned by another Pokémon, that Pokémon will be inflicted with the same status condition."},{"name":"Early Bird","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon awakens from sleep twice as fast as other Pokémon."},{"name":"Magic Bounce","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon reflects status moves instead of getting hit by them."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"forest","color":"Green","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":177,"name":"Natu","condition":null,"children":[{"id":178,"name":"Xatu","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[0,403],[1,43],[1,64],[1,100],[1,366],[1,500],[15,109],[20,101],[28,375],[34,384],[34,385],[41,94],[48,273],[55,248]],"machine":[403,502,213,226,347,322,605,203,263,19,492,248,202,416,447,385,257,63,286,113,478,384,182,94,473,240,115,156,496,247,285,214,173,76,211,500,164,241,129,168,86,271,433,369,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[814,797]},"cards":[{"id":"sv4pt5-26","name":"Xatu","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Rare","number":"26","artist":"DOM","img":"sv4pt5/26"},{"id":"sv4pt5-152","name":"Xatu","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Shiny Rare","number":"152","artist":"nagimiso","img":"sv4pt5/152"},{"id":"sv4-72","name":"Xatu","set":"Paradox Rift","date":"2023-11-03","rarity":"Rare","number":"72","artist":"Tetsu Kayama","img":"sv4/72"},{"id":"svp-59","name":"Xatu","set":"Scarlet & Violet Black Star Promos","date":"2023-01-01","rarity":"Promo","number":"59","artist":"GOSSAN","img":"svp/59"},{"id":"pgo-33","name":"Xatu","set":"Pokémon GO","date":"2022-07-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"33","artist":"Hataya","img":"pgo/33"},{"id":"swsh2-77","name":"Xatu","set":"Rebel Clash","date":"2020-05-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"77","artist":"so-taro","img":"swsh2/77"},{"id":"sm12-79","name":"Xatu","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity":"Rare","number":"79","artist":"Anesaki Dynamic","img":"sm12/79"},{"id":"sm8-88","name":"Xatu","set":"Lost Thunder","date":"2018-11-02","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"88","artist":"Ken Sugimori","img":"sm8/88"},{"id":"xy6-29","name":"Xatu","set":"Roaring Skies","date":"2015-05-06","rarity":"Rare","number":"29","artist":"Hajime Kusajima","img":"xy6/29"},{"id":"bw11-